    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I love math—it’s practical and creative. As a computer science enthusiast, I use it daily for coding and problem-solving. My upper secondary education gave me a strong foundation, and I enjoy applying it to real-world projects like optimizing algorithms. It’s not just numbers; it’s logic and structure.",
